{
  "_comment": [
    "The config files teltonika.py pushes to /etc/config/ on the router, in order.",
    "This is deliberately NOT 'every file in configs/'. og_configs/ holds 94 files;",
    "only these 82 are pushed. The 12 left alone are device-local state that must",
    "survive provisioning: certificates, log, speedtest, and the siteman_* group",
    "(the router's site-manager registration). Overwriting them would clobber",
    "per-unit data, so a naive os.listdir() loop here would be a real regression.",
    "Extracted verbatim from the 82 hardcoded sftp.put() calls this replaced."
